WEBVTT

00:00:14.022 --> 00:00:16.382
Oh, my-- Are you kidding me?

00:00:17.443 --> 00:00:18.842
I can't believe it.

00:00:19.642 --> 00:00:21.623
How did you--

00:00:22.163 --> 00:00:23.543
It's-- It's all here.

00:00:27.295 --> 00:00:29.190
[Maddie chuckles]

00:00:34.182 --> 00:00:36.363
Look at this! Are you kidding?
And the beanbag?

00:00:36.602 --> 00:00:38.743
No way! [chuckles]
How did you even get this?

00:00:38.844 --> 00:00:41.402
And you got it
all the way over--
Oh! [laughs]

00:00:41.503 --> 00:00:43.222
I love it, I love it,
I love it, I love it!

00:00:47.103 --> 00:00:49.423
[sighs]
Well, welcome home.

00:00:49.763 --> 00:00:52.163
Thank you, so much.

00:00:54.491 --> 00:00:56.056
[chuckles]

00:00:59.288 --> 00:01:00.958
[Ozzy barking]

00:01:01.263 --> 00:01:02.663
[Sonic] Oh, no, you don't.

00:01:02.923 --> 00:01:05.603
No second-best animal friends
allowed in my room.

00:01:05.655 --> 00:01:07.345
[Ozzy barks]
Wait. What are you doing?

00:01:07.583 --> 00:01:09.783
Stay away from me.
[laughs] Stop it!

00:01:10.043 --> 00:01:11.683
I'm warning you.
I've got nunchucks!

00:01:11.903 --> 00:01:14.143
Hey, stop.
Okay, you can stay.

00:01:14.246 --> 00:01:15.862
[laughing]
[Ozzy barking]

00:01:22.739 --> 00:01:24.390
[water splashes]

00:01:31.233 --> 00:01:35.172
My grasp on sanity remains...
absolute.

00:01:36.893 --> 00:01:38.172
Isn't that right,
Agent Stone?

00:01:39.655 --> 00:01:42.850
[grunting]

00:01:43.573 --> 00:01:45.452
Why don't you get a head start?

00:01:45.568 --> 00:01:47.497
[loud grunt]
[rock thudding]

00:01:47.613 --> 00:01:49.172
Do some rock-connaissance.
[cackles]

00:01:50.972 --> 00:01:53.572
Rock-connaissance!
Come on! That's hilarious!

00:01:54.032 --> 00:01:55.032
What's the matter with you?

00:01:55.933 --> 00:01:59.032
[beeps]
Here's the "sitch."
Uninhabited planet.

00:02:00.513 --> 00:02:04.593
No resources, no supplies,
no apparent way home.

00:02:05.592 --> 00:02:06.868
[chuckles]

00:02:06.972 --> 00:02:08.653
A lesser man would die here.

00:02:10.396 --> 00:02:11.536
[quill buzzing]

00:02:11.632 --> 00:02:13.193
I'll be home by Christmas.

00:02:16.411 --> 00:02:20.258
[making servo noises]

00:02:26.694 --> 00:02:29.177
[grunts]

00:02:31.136 --> 00:02:32.850
[yells]

00:02:32.954 --> 00:02:35.159
Rock-connaissance!

00:02:35.647 --> 00:02:38.026
[loud cackling]

00:02:38.132 --> 00:02:40.332
Come on! Cheer up!

00:02:40.435 --> 00:02:43.750
["Speed Me Up" plays]

00:04:38.891 --> 00:04:41.928
[beeping]

00:04:42.033 --> 00:04:44.533
If these readings are accurate,
he's here.

00:04:45.033 --> 00:04:46.033
I found him.

00:04:46.333 --> 00:04:47.772
I just hope I'm not too late.

00:04:49.275 --> 00:04:50.388
[grunts]

00:04:57.156 --> 00:05:00.134
["Speed Me Up" plays]

